fakeplayer-folia

This product is a derived work of minecraft-fakeplayer
(https://github.com/tanyaofei/minecraft-fakeplayer) authored by hello09x /
tanyaofei and distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Notable changes made in this fork:
  * Folia support: every BukkitScheduler call is routed through a reflective
    scheduler abstraction (io.github.hello09x.fakeplayer.core.util.scheduler.Tasks)
    that dispatches to the EntityScheduler / RegionScheduler /
    GlobalRegionScheduler / AsyncScheduler on Folia, and falls back to the Bukkit
    main-thread scheduler on Paper/Purpur.
  * Refactored ActionManager to use per-region timers instead of a single global
    tick timer.
  * Added the plugin flag `folia-supported: true`.
  * Added version modules for Minecraft 1.21.11 and the new 26.x version format.

